        <inlineHelpText>Indicates if the contact has opted out of emails. Read only from Eloqua. No = Opted IN to emails. Contact by email is OK. Yes = Opted OUT of emails. Don’t contact by email. Blank = Not opted in to emails. Don’t contact by email in restricted countries.</inlineHelpText>
